*Abstaining (uncommitted centre): [+ vonc_abstain +]*


@hugenberg_cooked
on-arrival: dnvp_party_leader = "PLACEHOLDER — likely Walther Lambach or compromise candidate"; dnvp_ideology = "PLACEHOLDER"; old_middle_dnvp -= 5; rural_dnvp -= 3; workers_dnvp += 3; new_middle_dnvp += 5; pro_republic += 5; nationalism -= 5; dnvp_relation -= 20; lmabach_stage = 2

= PLACEHOLDER HEADER — Hugenberg has been defeated in the vote of no confidence!

PLACEHOLDER: outcome paragraph — Hugenberg ousted, Lambach/coalition triumphant, consequences for DNF split plans, party realignment.


@hugenberg_survives
on-arrival: lmabach_stage = -2

= PLACEHOLDER HEADER — Hugenberg survives the vote of no confidence!

PLACEHOLDER: outcome paragraph — Hugenberg survives, purges dissidents, Lambach's remaining influence crushed or driven further out, party trajectory locked in toward Hugenbergite radicalization.
